# Context map

| Task | Required target context | Add when needed |
|---|---|---|
| Explain the subject | {{SUBJECT_ENTRY_CONTEXT}} | Sources and limitations |
| Research a claim | Source register and relevant concept | Validation queue and Graphify |
| Write new original English prose | Manifest `roles.authoring_policy` path, or `AUTHORING.md` fallback; the relevant source and intended reader task | DenchCo ASD-STE100-inspired 80% house style, protected text, stricter local policy, and material exceptions; no computed score or compliance claim |
| Maintain the Wiki | Manifest, agent guide, and change log | Design and runtime contracts |
| Prepare a development response | Manifest capability, canonical Human Wiki URL, and captured response draft | Markdown/HTML/plain-GFM link forms; `--managed-live` exact service identity and route HTTP; host pre-send hook for an uncaptured response |
| Select follow-up work | Current goal and project status | Failed or unrun checks and unparked validation items |
| Propose a reusable Standard change | [Tracked proposal workflow](standard-proposals.md), verified originating commit/JJ phase, and immutable Standard pin | Marker matches, affected contract, licence/browser evidence, fixture, migration impact, payload/form digest, upstream registry, and adoption authority |
